notices are retained. See LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md for complete terms
and notices for PDF.js, Tesseract.js, tessdata_fast, Vue, WXT, and other
dependencies.

Chrome Web Store readiness materials in v0.1.1 review and adapt the directory
structure and release-checklist pattern from OnlyTranslate commit
3f5f16e8d94bc7f8f04add9264b804032c70d1b3. Mercury-specific listing copy,
privacy pages, screenshots, icon, promo tile, identifiers, and upload
